  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-CWSEC" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth Secretariat</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy for Small States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to mobilise global action and support for small states to tackle development challenges. The Secretariat has developed an advocacy strategy in close collaboration with the UN. In the process, countries have nominated advocacy champions whose main mandate is to advocate for international recognition and action in addressing issues facing small and vulnerable states, particularly the reduction of poverty and vulnerabilities. The advocacy strategy seeks to leverage joint actions, leadership, and unwavering commitment to achieve set goals, inability small states to be mobilisers of global efforts and facilitators of engagements and partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
